    "title": "Dayton teen jailed after high-speed chase from Mansfield ends in Ashland - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hayden Gray ,\n1 hours ago ASHLAND — An 18-year-old Dayton man is in custody Wednesday night following a high-speed chase that began in Richland County and ended in Ashland. Jeremiah Mallory, 18, of Dayton, was taken into custody Wednesday afternoon after leading numerous law enforcement agencies on a multi-county chase that originated in Mansfield near the intersection of North Stewart Road and Grace Street. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
